# US-050: Sequence Diagram — Upload de Virtual Sound (VS)

**Feature:** Upload de VS com Chunked Upload  
**Bounded Context:** Media Context  
**Complexidade:** Alta (7 componentes interagindo)  
**Formato:** Mermaid Sequence Diagram

---

## 1. Fluxo Completo: Upload End-to-End

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Usuário
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(React)
    participant API as Backend API<br/>(Supabase/NestJS)
    participant DB as Database<br/>(Postgres)
    participant S3 as AWS S3<br/>(Active Storage)
    participant Lambda as Lambda<br/>(Processor)
    participant CDN as CloudFront<br/>(CDN)
    participant Notif as Notification<br/>Context

    %% ===== FASE 1: INITIATE UPLOAD =====
    Note over U,Notif: FASE 1: Initiate Upload
    U->>+FE: Seleciona arquivo .wav (200MB)
    FE->>FE: Valida MIME type, tamanho
    FE->>+API: POST /media/upload-url<br/>{fileName, fileSize, songId}
    
    API->>+DB: INSERT media_files<br/>(status='pending')
    DB-->>-API: mediaFileId
    
    API->>+S3: InitiateMultipartUpload<br/>worship-plus-media-active/vs/
    S3-->>-API: uploadId + presignedUrls[]<br/>(40 chunks de 5MB)
    
    API->>DB: UPDATE media_files<br/>SET uploadId, status='uploading'
    
    API-->>-FE: {<br/>  mediaFileId,<br/>  uploadId,<br/>  chunkUrls[] (40 URLs),<br/>  expiresIn: 900 (15min)<br/>}
    
    FE-->>U: Exibe progress bar<br/>"Preparando upload..."
    FE->>-FE: Divide arquivo em chunks (5MB cada)
    
    %% ===== FASE 2: UPLOAD CHUNKS =====
    Note over U,Notif: FASE 2: Upload Chunks (Paralelo)
    
    loop Para cada chunk (1 a 40)
        U->>+FE: Upload em progresso...
        FE->>+S3: PUT /presignedUrl[i]<br/>Body: chunk[i] (5MB)
        Note over FE,S3: Header: Content-Type=application/octet-stream
        
        alt Upload Bem-Sucedido
            S3-->>FE: 200 OK<br/>ETag: "abc123..."
            FE->>FE: Armazena ETag<br/>Atualiza progress: (i/40)*100%
            FE-->>U: Mostra progress: 45%
        else Upload Falhou (Network Error)
            S3-->>FE: ❌ 500 / Timeout
            FE->>FE: Retry (tentativa 1/3)
            FE->>S3: PUT /presignedUrl[i]<br/>Body: chunk[i] (retry)
            S3-->>FE: 200 OK (na 2ª tentativa)
        else Falhou 3 Vezes
            FE->>API: POST /media/abort<br/>{uploadId}
            API->>S3: AbortMultipartUpload
            API->>DB: UPDATE media_files<br/>SET status='failed'
            API->>Notif: Emit VSUploadFailed
            Notif-->>U: Push: "Upload falhou"
            FE-->>-U: Erro: "Upload falhou após 3 tentativas"
        end
    end
    
    Note over FE: Todos os 40 chunks enviados
    FE-->>U: Progress: 100%<br/>"Finalizando upload..."
    
    %% ===== FASE 3: COMPLETE UPLOAD =====
    Note over U,Notif: FASE 3: Complete Multipart Upload
    
    FE->>+API: POST /media/complete<br/>{uploadId, etags[], mediaFileId}
    
    API->>+S3: CompleteMultipartUpload<br/>{uploadId, parts:[{partNumber, etag}]}
    Note over S3: S3 consolida 40 chunks<br/>em 1 arquivo .wav
    S3-->>-API: 200 OK<br/>{s3Key, bucket, size}
    
    API->>+DB: UPDATE media_files SET<br/>  status='processing',<br/>  s3_key, bucket, size,<br/>  uploaded_at=NOW()
    DB-->>-API: OK
    
    API->>+Lambda: Invoke ProcessVS<br/>{mediaFileId, s3Key}
    Note over Lambda: Evento assíncrono<br/>(não bloqueia response)
    Lambda-->>-API: Accepted (202)
    
    API-->>-FE: 200 OK {<br/>  mediaFileId,<br/>  status: 'processing',<br/>  message: 'Upload concluído!<br/>  Processando áudio...'<br/>}
    
    FE-->>U: Sucesso: "Upload concluído!<br/>Processando áudio..."
    FE->>-U: Redireciona para lista de VS
    
    %% ===== FASE 4: PROCESSING (Assíncrono) =====
    Note over U,Notif: FASE 4: Processing (Assíncrono)
    
    activate Lambda
    Lambda->>+S3: GetObject<br/>original.wav (200MB)
    S3-->>-Lambda: Arquivo .wav
    
    Lambda->>Lambda: Transcode com ffmpeg:<br/>- original.wav → mp3 (20MB)<br/>- original.wav → aac (15MB)<br/>- original.wav → webm (18MB)
    
    Lambda->>+S3: PutObject<br/>versions/mp3, aac, webm
    S3-->>-Lambda: 200 OK (3 versões salvas)
    
    Lambda->>Lambda: Gerar thumbnail<br/>(waveform preview)
    
    Lambda->>+S3: PutObject<br/>thumbnails/waveform.png
    S3-->>-Lambda: 200 OK
    
    Lambda->>+DB: UPDATE media_files SET<br/>  status='ready',<br/>  versions={mp3, aac, webm},<br/>  thumbnail_url,<br/>  processed_at=NOW()
    DB-->>-Lambda: OK
    
    Lambda->>+CDN: Invalidate Cache<br/>/vs/{mediaFileId}/*
    CDN-->>-Lambda: OK
    
    Lambda->>+Notif: Emit VSProcessingCompleted<br/>{mediaFileId, userId}
    Notif->>Notif: Cria notificação no DB
    Notif-->>U: Push Notification:<br/>"Áudio pronto para uso!"
    Notif-->>-Lambda: OK
    
    deactivate Lambda
    
    %% ===== FASE 5: CONSUMO (Usuário Acessa) =====
    Note over U,Notif: FASE 5: Consumo do VS
    
    U->>+FE: Acessa evento<br/>"Culto Domingo"
    FE->>+API: GET /events/{eventId}/setlist
    API->>+DB: SELECT songs with media_files
    DB-->>-API: Songs + VS URLs
    API-->>-FE: {<br/>  songs: [{<br/>    id, title,<br/>    vs: {<br/>      mp3: cdn.com/vs/123.mp3,<br/>      aac: cdn.com/vs/123.aac<br/>    }<br/>  }]<br/>}
    
    FE->>+CDN: GET /vs/123.mp3<br/>(Audio Player)
    CDN->>CDN: Cache HIT (já servido antes)
    CDN-->>-FE: 200 OK<br/>audio/mpeg (20MB)
    
    FE-->>-U: 🎵 Audio Player<br/>tocando música
```

