## 3. Fluxo de Lifecycle: Archival (Evento >30 dias)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as CloudWatch Event<br/>(Daily Cron)
    participant Lambda as Archival Lambda
    participant DB as Database
    participant S3 as S3 Active
    participant Glacier as S3 Glacier
    
    Note over Cron,Glacier: Executado diariamente às 2am UTC
    
    Cron->>+Lambda: Invoke ArchivalLambda
    
    Lambda->>+DB: SELECT media_files<br/>WHERE event_date < NOW() - 30 days<br/>AND storage_class='STANDARD'
    DB-->>-Lambda: [mediaFile1, mediaFile2, ...]
    
    loop Para cada mediaFile
        Lambda->>+S3: CopyObject<br/>from: active/vs/123.wav<br/>to: archive/vs/123.wav<br/>StorageClass: GLACIER
        S3-->>Glacier: Transfere para Glacier
        Glacier-->>-Lambda: OK (arquivado)
        
        Lambda->>+S3: DeleteObject<br/>active/vs/123.wav
        S3-->>-Lambda: OK (deletado do Active)
        
        Lambda->>+DB: UPDATE media_files SET<br/>  storage_class='GLACIER',<br/>  archived_at=NOW()
        DB-->>-Lambda: OK
    end
    
    Lambda-->>-Cron: OK (X arquivos arquivados)
    
    Note over Cron,Glacier: Custo reduzido:<br/>$0.023/GB (Active) → $0.004/GB (Glacier)
```

