## 4. Fluxo de Restore: Usuário Solicita VS Arquivado

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Usuário
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant Glacier as S3 Glacier
    participant S3 as S3 Active
    participant Notif as Notification<br/>Context
    
    U->>+FE: Clica em "Baixar VS"<br/>(evento antigo)
    FE->>+API: GET /media/{id}/download-url
    
    API->>+DB: SELECT storage_class<br/>FROM media_files<br/>WHERE id={id}
    DB-->>-API: {storage_class: 'GLACIER'}
    
    API->>API: Verifica: Arquivo está em Glacier
    
    alt Restore já em progresso
        API-->>FE: 202 Accepted {<br/>  status: 'restoring',<br/>  estimatedTime: '3-5 horas'<br/>}
        FE-->>U: "Arquivo em restauração.<br/>Você será notificado."
    else Iniciar Restore
        API->>+Glacier: RestoreObject<br/>Tier: Standard (3-5h)<br/>Days: 1
        Glacier-->>-API: 202 Accepted
        
        API->>DB: UPDATE media_files<br/>SET restore_status='restoring',<br/>  restore_initiated_at=NOW()
        
        API->>+Notif: Emit VSRestoreInitiated<br/>{mediaFileId, userId}
        Notif->>DB: INSERT notification
        Notif-->>-API: OK
        
        API-->>-FE: 202 Accepted {<br/>  status: 'restoring',<br/>  estimatedTime: '3-5 horas'<br/>}
        FE-->>-U: "Restaurando arquivo.<br/>Você será notificado."
    end
    
    Note over Glacier: Glacier processa restore<br/>(3-5 horas)
    
    Glacier->>+S3: CopyObject<br/>to: active-temp/vs/123.wav<br/>(disponível por 1 dia)
    S3-->>-Glacier: OK
    
    Glacier->>+API: S3 Event Notification<br/>ObjectRestore:Completed
    API->>+DB: UPDATE media_files<br/>SET restore_status='ready',<br/>  restore_completed_at=NOW()
    DB-->>-API: OK
    
    API->>+Notif: Emit VSRestoreCompleted<br/>{mediaFileId, userId}
    Notif-->>U: Push: "Arquivo pronto<br/>para download!"
    Notif-->>-API: OK
    
    U->>+FE: Acessa notificação
    FE->>+API: GET /media/{id}/download-url
    API->>+S3: GeneratePresignedUrl<br/>active-temp/vs/123.wav<br/>ExpiresIn: 3600
    S3-->>-API: presignedUrl
    API-->>-FE: {downloadUrl, expiresAt}
    
    FE->>+S3: GET presignedUrl
    S3-->>-FE: 200 OK<br/>audio/wav (200MB)
    FE-->>-U: 🎵 Download iniciado
```

